 "text": "Hi, how things going? Totally understandable. Clubs usually drop newer riders mid winter, so the risk is being left without returning. What does the club say about new member's waiting? Tell them you want to come back. Keep it short and friendly. Most people won't drop you after that. Fair. And which club did you want check out? Did. And recommend I tell them you' coming from busy with work, so they expect bit of me. That gives them reason not to drop you. Perfect. They' usually keep a new member's spot open until the new season when they can review the whole club.",
